                  {
                    "name": "send_message",
                    "description": "Send a message to a direct continuable child by its agent id. If you are a resident continuable child, you may also target your direct parent. If the target is still working, the message steers its nearest step; if it is inactive, the message starts or resumes a turn. This call returns no answer from the agent — only confirmation that the message was delivered. A failure means the message was NOT delivered.",
