                  {
                    "name": "team_request_control",
                    "description": "Request approval for one operation scope (kind: leader-approval | user-approval | envelope-mutation). The operation stays blocked until a resolver (leader/human per kind — never a member) records a decision. Idempotent over the scope identity: retrying with the same token returns the existing request.",
