              "text": "[team-control requestId=ctrl-0jp2wxz19t175m1y5c8c51vd]\nA Team member operation is waiting for Leader approval.\n\nrequestId: ctrl-0jp2wxz19t175m1y5c8c51vd\nrequester: inst-16anter1nqhy\nsubject: instance inst-16anter1nqhy\ntarget: inst-16anter1nqhy\ntool: bash\nsummary: bash [cwd=/home/user/dsh-plugins/dsh-agent-team/tests/deepseek-harness-test-use] [timeout=30000ms] echo prd-c2a-prd-control-2026-09-29T19-26-21 > /home/user/dsh-plugins/dsh-agent-team/tests/deepseek-harness-test-use/tmp...\n\nDecide with `team_resolve_control` using this EXACT requestId and a `decision` of `allow` or `deny`.\nRecover or inspect pending requests with `team_list_pending_control`."
